# Generator

- Edit specs in `plants.mjs` or `plants.generated.mjs`. Rendering is `build.mjs` → Schematex.
- Measurement edges are dashed after render (`dashMeasurementLinks` in `generate.mjs`). Bare crossings are not edges.
- Do not open generated `GEN-*` or `PLANT-*` trees to check a change. Run `node verify.mjs` on the tier you touched.
- Isolated crops are `components.mjs`, written to `component-symbols/`, not into plant folders.
